+- [ ] Rollback
+
+## Track B — CI/CD
+
+- [ ] Build
+- [ ] Lint / static checks
+- [ ] Tests
+- [ ] Artifacts
+- [ ] Deployment
+- [ ] Rollback strategy
+
+## Track C — Observability & Reliability
+
+- [ ] Structured logs
+- [ ] Metrics
